Package: com.itsallexb.weatherpad
Name: WeatherPad (iOS 12)
Version: 1.2.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Makes the iPhone Weather app ported to iPad (iOS 12) work like a native iPad app: a full-screen iPad layout in portrait and landscape that also adapts to Split View and Slide Over, and tapping the Today widget opens the Weather app instead of weather.com. Animated weather backgrounds are scaled to fill the iPad screen when the WeatherUI resources are installed. An iPhone-layout fallback is in Settings > Weather for iPad.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0), preferenceloader
